efault":false,"icon":"fire","another_icon":"","custom_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icons8-spa-candle-50.png","custom_icon":"","use_secondary_background":false,"heading":"Use & Care Instructions","tab_content":"<h3>Candle Care<\/h3><p>Follow these simple guidelines for a clean, even burn and safe enjoyment.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Trim the wick to ¼ inch<\/strong> before each burn for a clean, steady flame and reduced soot.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>First burn:<\/strong> allow wax to melt <strong>edge-to-edge (about 2–3 hours)<\/strong> to help prevent tunneling.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Never burn unattended<\/strong> or near anything flammable.<br\/><\/li><li>Keep away from <strong>drafts, children, and pets<\/strong>.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Allow the candle to cool completely<\/strong> before moving or handling.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><h3>Wax Melt Care<\/h3><ul><li>Place <strong>1–2 cubes<\/strong> in a dedicated wax warmer dish and turn the warmer on.<br\/><\/li><li>Allow wax to fully melt to release fragrance; <strong>adjust cubes<\/strong> for desired strength.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Never add water<\/strong> or other liquids to your warmer.<br\/><\/li><li>Keep warmers away from <strong>children and pets<\/strong>.<br\/><\/li><li>Let wax <strong>cool and solidify<\/strong> before removing.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><h3>Storage (Candles & Wax Melts)<\/h3><ul><li>Store in a <strong>cool, dry place<\/strong>, away from direct sunlight and heat to preserve fragrance.<br\/><\/li><li>Keep products <strong>covered or sealed<\/strong> when not in use to maintain scent freshness.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p><em><strong>Enjoy the clean, elevated fragrance of J | F Candle Co. — safely and beautifully.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>"}},"payment_methods_kHWDBf":{"type":"payment_methods","settings":{"heading":"Pay with","text":"Your transaction is protected with advanced security measures to keep your information confidential","custom_payment":"","show_secondary_background":false,"show_border":false,"background_